            "reported_speech_scope"
          ],
          "score": 5.702
        },
        {
          "origin": "ledger",
          "text": "Whereas, on the twenty-second day of September, in the year of our Lord one thousand eight hundred and sixty-two, a proclamation was issued by the President of the United States, containing, among other things, the following, to wit:",
